      "writtenOn": "2026-06-25T17:22:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jorge and I were thinking of adding a way of notifying the client in debug mode that the capturecanvas was actually a wrapper around the base canvas. This was to communicate that the canvas that is being referenced is different from other SkCanvas sub-classes. \n\nbut now that you mention it, I have noticed that it clogs up the logging since `getSurfaceBase()` happens quite frequently\n\n@jmbetancourt@google.com should we keep this as a debug message?",
