      "message": "It\u0027s a hacky way of using the index counter `i` as a unique id for the treenode. First you have to cast it to an `intptr_t` to avoid compiler warnings and then to void* to pass it into treenode. I found this piece of code within the Skia codebase that does a similar thing https://screenshot.googleplex.com/6ypjBC4GtgUAUN3\n\n\nI replaced it with ImGui::PushID, which I think might be cleaner. Alternatively, I could also pass in the `DrawCommand* cmd` variable as a unique ID (and cast it to void*).",
